You may copy, modify, distribute, deploy and commercially use this project and
derivative works. The only condition is that every copy, distribution and
derivative retains this license and the attribution notice below, and
prominently displays:
"攻防SRC-nwpucat — By 喜吾安璇 (WeChat: ainwpu, Official Account: 攻防SRC)".
The attribution may be shown as text, a link, or the QR image in
assets/wechat-official.png.

